Geometry x="0.1" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="817" y="440"/><mxPoint x="1573" y="440"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="LogQL" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E8E3E;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#1E8E3E;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.7;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c22"><mxGeometry x="-0.2" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="833" y="455"/><mxPoint x="1490" y="455"/><mxPoint x="1490" y="808"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="Cypher" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E8E3E;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#1E8E3E;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="715" y="545"/><mxPoint x="715" y="808"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="MCP&lt;br&gt;(port-forward)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E8E3E;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#1E8E3E;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c30" target="c12"><mxGeometry x="-0.86" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="부하 · 락 경합" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#879196;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#879196;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c17" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1240" y="797"/><mxPoint x="1240" y="542"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="&lt;b&gt;흐름 읽는 법&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2088FF&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;파랑 ①~⑥ 앱 배포&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: 팀원 PR → 머지 → 호스팅 러너가 이미지 빌드·GHCR push → 홈랩 앱 러너가 &lt;code&gt;charts/ngds&lt;/code&gt;를 ns ngds에 helm upgrade&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8C4FFF&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;보라 ⑦~⑧ 수집기 배포&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: &lt;code&gt;charts/ngds-monitoring&lt;/code&gt; 변경 머지 → monitoring.yml이 관리자 승인 대기 → 승인되면 앱 러너가 Environment secret(main 전용)으로 설치&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#E57000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;주황 수집&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: Prometheus가 exporter·kubelet을 긁고, promtail이 노드의 ngds 파드 로그를 Loki로 보낸다&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1E8E3E&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;초록 분석&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: LLM → MCP → check_health(Prometheus) → get_diagnosis(Neo4j KG) → query_promql/logql로 근거 확인" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="1290" width="1000" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="&lt;b&gt;왜 네임스페이스가 둘인가&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;수집기는 hostPath·hostNetwork·ClusterRole이 필요하다 → 거기에 파드를 만들 수 있으면 노드 root.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;그래서 팀원·앱 러너는 restricted인 &lt;b&gt;ngds&lt;/b&gt;에서만 파드를 만들고, privileged인 &lt;b&gt;ngds-monitoring&lt;/b&gt;은 관리자 승인을 거친 배포만 들어간다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;팀원의 수집기 접근: Prometheus·Loki Service 프록시 &lt;b&gt;GET&lt;/b&gt;만 (port-forward·exec 없음). 앱 러너 디스크에는 privileged 권한을 두지 않는다(브랜치 워크플로로 꺼낼 수 있어서) → 승인된 main job에만 secret으로 전달." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="1290" width="900" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>